                          "marginTop": 8,
                          "marginBottom": 34
                        }
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "co-preventive-maintenance-3-cta",
                          "type": "buttons",
                          "props": {
                            "align": "left",
                            "items": [
                              {
                                "ctaId": "order-parts-online",
                                "label": "Visit Our Parts Department →",
                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-parts-quality",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Role of Parts Quality in Long-Term Cost Control",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "parts-quality"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-parts-quality-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the most overlooked drivers of fleet maintenance expenses is parts quality. Cheaper parts may reduce upfront costs, but they often fail sooner, cause collateral damage, or require more labor to replace. Using reliable, properly matched parts helps:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-parts-quality-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Reduce repeat repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Protect major systems like engines and transmissions"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Improve overall uptime"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Lower lifetime cost to maintain a semi truck"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-parts-quality-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, our parts team works directly with technicians and customers to ensure the right part is used the first time, saving both time and money.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-service-expertise",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Service Expertise Matters More Than Ever",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "service-expertise"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-expertise-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Modern semi trucks are more advanced than ever. Diagnostics, emissions systems, and integrated electronics require trained technicians who understand today's equipment. Choosing the right service partner can dramatically reduce unnecessary repairs and shorten downtime.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-expertise-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A professional service department doesn't just fix problems; it helps you plan maintenance schedules, track trends, and make informed decisions that stabilize semi truck maintenance costs year over year.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-how-we-help",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Sun State International Helps Lower Maintenance Costs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "how-we-help"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-we-help-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We know that for owner-operators and fleets alike, every dollar matters. That's why Sun State International focuses on being more than a repair stop. Our parts and service teams are built to support long-term reliability, not just one-time fixes. We offer:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-how-we-help-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Experienced technicians who understand real-world trucking demands"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "A well-stocked parts department to reduce downtime"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Straightforward communication and transparent service recommendations"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Support for both individual trucks and growing fleets"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-we-help-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're ready to take control of your truck operating costs, our Service Department is here to help.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/the-real-average-maintenance-cost-for-a-semi-truck/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Well-maintained Sun State International semi truck back on the road"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-well-maintained-fleet",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Support You Need for a Well-Maintained Fleet",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "well-maintained-fleet"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-well-maintained-fleet-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The average maintenance cost for a semi truck isn't just a number; it's a reflection of how well that truck is cared for over time. Preventive maintenance, quality parts, and expert service all work together to protect uptime and profitability.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-well-maintained-fleet-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When maintenance is handled proactively, it becomes a predictable investment instead of a financial surprise. And that's exactly the kind of support Sun State International is built to provide: dependable, professional, and focused on keeping you moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-well-maintained-fleet-3",
                  "type": "buttons",
